oal.net/image/jaoe38c1m03uku2g/ad394f98-d4d3-4344-9e76-bf3c13c8c127/56d4bb80-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03uku2h.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 23 English Option 4\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m03uku2g/ad394f98-d4d3-4344-9e76-bf3c13c8c127/56d4bb80-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03uku2h.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m03uku2g/ad394f98-d4d3-4344-9e76-bf3c13c8c127/56d4bb80-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03uku2h.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m03uku2g/ad394f98-d4d3-4344-9e76-bf3c13c8c127/56d4bb80-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03uku2h.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1m03uku2g/ad394f98-d4d3-4344-9e76-bf3c13c8c127/56d4bb80-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03uku2h.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1m03uku2g/ad394f98-d4d3-4344-9e76-bf3c13c8c127/56d4bb80-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03uku2h.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1m03uku2g/ad394f98-d4d3-4344-9e76-bf3c13c8c127/56d4bb80-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03uku2h.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p></p><p>The reactant, phthalimide, undergoes an acid-base reaction with KOH. In this reaction, the proton from the nitrogen reacts with the OH<sup>-</sup> from the base to form water.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m03up63w/9ad29459-755a-442f-862a-1c2abcce3d8d/cf5e46c0-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up63x.png?format=png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 23 English Explanation 1\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m03up63w/9ad29459-755a-442f-862a-1c2abcce3d8d/cf5e46c0-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up63x.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m03up63w/9ad29459-755a-442f-862a-1c2abcce3d8d/cf5e46c0-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up63x.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m03up63w/9ad29459-755a-442f-862a-1c2abcce3d8d/cf5e46c0-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up63x.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1m03up63w/9ad29459-755a-442f-862a-1c2abcce3d8d/cf5e46c0-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up63x.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1m03up63w/9ad29459-755a-442f-862a-1c2abcce3d8d/cf5e46c0-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up63x.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1m03up63w/9ad29459-755a-442f-862a-1c2abcce3d8d/cf5e46c0-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up63x.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p></p>\n<p></p><p>The resulting salt then undergoes a substitution reaction with p-bromobenzyl chloride to form the major product. This reaction proceeds via an S<sub>N</sub>1 mechanism due to the stability of the p-bromobenzyl cation.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m03up4e9/ce5dd523-f93c-4940-a222-dc0fce69956e/ce0baf10-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up4ea.png?format=png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 23 English Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m03up4e9/ce5dd523-f93c-4940-a222-dc0fce69956e/ce0baf10-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up4ea.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m03up4e9/ce5dd523-f93c-4940-a222-dc0fce69956e/ce0baf10-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up4ea.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m03up4e9/ce5dd523-f93c-4940-a222-dc0fce69956e/ce0baf10-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up4ea.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1m03up4e9/ce5dd523-f93c-4940-a222-dc0fce69956e/ce0baf10-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up4ea.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1m03up4e9/ce5dd523-f93c-4940-a222-dc0fce69956e/ce0baf10-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up4ea.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1m03up4e9/ce5dd523-f93c-4940-a222-dc0fce69956e/ce0baf10-5fbb-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03up4ea.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m03ut9em/c0ea60ba-9448-449c-87ea-64584f8dee07/4126ffe0-5fbc-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03ut9en.png?format=png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 23 English Explanation 3\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m03ut9em/c0ea60ba-9448-449c-87ea-64584f8dee07/4126ffe0-5fbc-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03ut9en.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m03ut9em/c0ea60ba-9448-449c-87ea-64584f8dee07/4126ffe0-5fbc-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03ut9en.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m03ut9em/c0ea60ba-9448-449c-87ea-64584f8dee07/4126ffe0-5fbc-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03ut9en.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1m03ut9em/c0ea60ba-9448-449c-87ea-64584f8dee07/4126ffe0-5fbc-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03ut9en.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1m03ut9em/c0ea60ba-9448-449c-87ea-64584f8dee07/4126ffe0-5fbc-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03ut9en.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1m03ut9em/c0ea60ba-9448-449c-87ea-64584f8dee07/4126ffe0-5fbc-11ef-9855-9198f428b4b2/file-jaoe38c1m03ut9en.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p></p>\n"}]}